          "Because starch synthase and sucrose 6-phosphate synthase evolved from different ancestral enzymes and the nucleotide specificity is a frozen accident with no functional consequence",
          "Because ATP is abundant in the plastid where photophosphorylation occurs and UTP is abundant in the cytosol, so each compartment simply uses whichever nucleotide it has"
